-ita
pos: suffix
  meta: {{es-noun|f|m=+}}
  g: f
  usage: The diminutive -ita may be used on masculine nouns ending in -a, and -ito may be used on feminine nouns ending in -o. If the noun ends in -e, -n, or -r, add -cita. If the last consonant is t, add -ica.
  gloss: a suffix indicating a diminutive; female equivalent of "-ito"
