  gloss: Manuel Quezon (2nd president of the Philippines)
    q: Philippines
  gloss: A province, Calabarzon of Luzon in the Philippines, Former name: Tayabas
  gloss: several locations in the Philippines:
    _gloss: A municipality of Quezon, Luzon in the Philippines, on the southern tip of Alabat island
    _gloss: A municipality of Isabela, Luzon in the Philippines
