cuan
pos: adv
  meta: {{es-adv}}
  usage: Used with adjectives and adverbs. Rare in modern speech, usually replaced with que, tan, cuanto, or como de. Written with an accent mark (cuán) when interrogative or exclamative, as in ¿Cuán grande es? or ¡Cuán grande es!
  etymology: Inherited from Latin "quam". Ultimately from Proto-Indo-European "*kʷís".
  gloss: how, to what extent
    q: literary
_____
