  gloss: when
pos: conj
  meta: {{head|es|conjunction}}
  usage: This same word also functions as the interrogative pronoun when?, but in such case it is written with an accent mark to distinguish it from this meaning: ¿cuándo?
  etymology: Inherited from Latin quandō. Compare English "cue" and when.
  gloss: when
