    q: derogatory, vulgar, chiefly Latin America
  gloss: dumbass (stupid person)
    q: derogatory, vulgar, chiefly Latin America
    syn: idiota; (Spain) gilipollas; (Argentina, Dominican Republic) boludo
  gloss: young boy
    q: Cono Sur, colloquial
