  gloss: of irregular and disorderly life
    q: colloquial
  gloss: mistletoe
    q: Andalusia, colloquial
  gloss: type of pumpkin
    q: Andalusia, colloquial
pos: adj
  meta: {{es-adj}}
  usage: Although in some contexts zonzo, bobo, tonto, menso, culero, tarado, idiota, imbécil, estúpido and pendejo may be synonyms, in most contexts they have a different degree of intensity, with zonzo having the mildest connotation, increasing in intensity in that rough order, to estúpido and pendejo, which have the most offensive meaning.
  etymology: Inherited from Vulgar Latin "*pectinī̆culum", diminutive of Latin "pecten" (“pubic hair; comb”). The unexpected /nd/ may be due to the influence of pender (“hang down, dangle”). Compare Portuguese "pentelho".
  gloss: stupid, idiot, asshole
