  meta: {{es-noun|m}}
  g: m
  gloss: lounge-dining room, parlor-dining room, sitting-dining room, living-dining room; i.e., a room in some house designs that serves and combines two functions: the salón (the room of a house where visiting guests are received and can lounge) and also the comedor (dining room)
