somos el mejor país de Chile
pos: phrase
  meta: {{head|es|phrase}}
  etymology: Phrase attributed to a Chile national football team fan during a television interview in 2017, after Chile's victory in the Copa América Centenario. The phrase was intended to express national pride but was syntactically incorrect, since Chile is the country itself. It quickly became a catchphrase and Internet meme in Chile, often used humorously to express exaggerated patriotism or self-irony. Literally "we are the best country of Chile".
  gloss: Used to express exaggerated national pride or as a humorous self-deprecating phrase implying that Chile is the best country in the world. Often used ironically, in memes, or simply as a humorous catchphrase
    q: Chile, Internet slang, humorous
